{
  "_about": "Machine-readable description of the low-memory deployment modes of mrmap (issue #1624, epic #1612). This file follows the convention of scripts/release_lifecycle.json (#1585): it is the interface the documentation automation (#1604) generates from and the interface an offline suite verifies against. scripts/test_low_memory_deployment.py holds every fact here against the committed reality it names - the compose files, the two resolvers which actually decode the knobs, the measurement pages it quotes - so a mode which stops being real goes red here before an operator reads it. It describes the modes and their measured tradeoffs; it holds no number which is not on a linked page, and it labels every figure measured or derived.",
  "schema_version": 1,
  "epic": 1612,
  "runbook": {
    "page": "docs/source/administration/low-memory-operator-runbook.rst",
    "label": "low-memory-operator-runbook",
    "sections": [
      "Modes",
